# =============================================================================
# Iturrieta client — public Vite variables only (safe to commit)
# Copy to `.env` for local dev. Never put secrets or SMTP/JWT values here.
# =============================================================================

# API base including version prefix.
# Default (omit or leave unset): `/api/v1` — same-origin on Vercel (vercel.json proxy)
# and on local Vite dev (vite.config.ts proxy → http://localhost:5000).
#
# Optional: talk to Express directly without the dev proxy:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#
# Production (Vercel): DO NOT set the Render URL here — cookies will not attach and staff APIs return 401.
# Omit `VITE_API_BASE_URL` entirely (or use `/api/v1` only). Requests must go to your Vercel domain
# so vercel.json can proxy to Render same-origin.
